    "blurb": "Connect to SAP using OData",
    "overview": "Integrate SAP into business processes using OData v2 and V4. This connector complies with SAP's Clean Core strategy, ensuring it's future-proof.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Orchestrate SAP tasks and data with the Camunda OData V2 and V4 connector",
    "splashDescription": "Integrate SAP into Camunda-powered business processes with this SAP Certified hybrid connector, at no additional license cost for Camunda users. Camunda’s open, composable architecture enables you to orchestrate SAP tasks and data as part of end-to-end business processes, which improves process visibility, increases your business agility, and facilitates alignment between IT teams and business stakeholders. Add this connector to a process model in order to connect to any SAP system using OData V2 and V4. This connector complies with SAP's Clean Core strategy, ensuring your integration is future-proof.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/500371/overview/img3417469966580122067.png?faef805c573001a5aabfe91c8f2c2ec5",
